  entry .IntMultiplication   the `Int*Int` instance, inlined to one instruction
  entry .FloatMultiplication   the `Float*Float` instance, inlined to one instruction
  entry .ShortMultiplication   the `Short*Short` instance, wrapping back to a `Short`
  entry .ByteMultiplication   the `Byte*Byte` instance, wrapping back to a `Byte`
